1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:03,030
(Leonard:)Because I don't
need his girlfriend

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:05,450
(Leonard:)to set me up with one
of her girlfriends.

3
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:08,740
(Leonard:)I'm perfectly capable of
finding a girl on my own.

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,790
(Raj:)Oh, Leonard, you remind me

5
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:12,960
(Raj:)of the funny old story
about a man

6
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,940
(Raj:)who walks into a women's
correctional institution

7
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,300
(Raj:)with a stack of paperwork

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,830
(Raj:)that will allow
the female convicts to go free.

9
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,730
(Leonard:)You're saying I
couldn't get laid

10
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:24,250
(Leonard:)in a women's prison with
a handful of pardons.

11
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:26,920
(Raj:)Are you going to let me
tell the story or not?

12
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,130
(Sheldon:)Leonard?

13
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:33,500
(Sheldon:)Are you sleeping?

14
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,730
(Sheldon:)No.

15
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:35,730
(Sheldon:)Are you ill?

16
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:36,770
(Sheldon:)No.

17
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,130
(Sheldon:)Are you still depressed

18
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:40,440
(Sheldon:)because you're alone,
and no one loves you?

19
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,920
(Leonard:)I don't know. Maybe.

20
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,270
(Sheldon:)I want you to know
that I'm genuinely concerned

21
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,530
(Sheldon:)about your well-being.

22
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:48,190
(Leonard:)Thank you.
You're welcome.

23
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:51,810
(Sheldon:)But it's still no reason
to have your feet in my spot.

24
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:56,990
(Amy(on webcam):)May I offer an observation?

25
00:00:58,790 --> 00:01:00,510
(Leonard:)What the hell?
How long has she been here?

